{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"妙法蓮華經校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"一.是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"二.譯校凡用五本。（一）梵文本妙法芬陀利迦經．校註略稱梵本。（二）藏文本日帝","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"等譯妙法白蓮華經．略稱藏本。以上二種並擧則稱梵藏本。（三）晉竺法護譯正","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"法華經．略稱晉本。（四）隋闍那崛多等譯添品妙法蓮華經．略稱隋本。（五）後魏","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"菩提流支等譯妙法蓮華經憂波提舍牒文．略稱論。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"三.譯校凡有三例。（一）各本品目文句歧異者．擇要註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）梵藏本","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"文義較暢者．擇要註出曰．勘梵藏本意雲雲。（三）因勘梵藏而見今譯未愜者．則","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"並加按語曰．今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"四.刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對勘基師法華音訓及麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"今依某本雲雲。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"五.今刊頌文悉依梵藏本釐正．註出序數．分頌排列。其詳略互異者．亦註出備考。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"六.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（一）梵本妙法芬陀利迦經．Saddharma-pun!d!ari^ka．柯恩氏H．Kern．及南條","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"文雄校刊．佛教文庫本．一九○八—一二年．聖彼得堡版。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（二）藏本妙法白蓮華經．dam-pah!ichospad-madkar-poshes-bya-batheg-pa","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"chen-poh!imdo．奈旦版甘珠．經集部ja字函．一頁至二八一頁下。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（三）晉本正法華經．日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（四）隋本添品妙法蓮華經．同上。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（五）論本妙法蓮華經憂波提舍．同上。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（六）基師法華音訓〈慧琳一切經音義卷二十七〉．同上。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"（七）本書南宋刻麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本之","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_82_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_82","text":"校註。","sortOrder":23}],"overrides":{}}